      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, here's a simple 4-week linear progression lifting program for beginners focusing on compound lifts like squats and deadlifts:\n\n**Weeks 1 & 2:**\n\n- Day 1 (Legs/Thrusters): \n  - Barbell Squats: 3 sets of 8-10 reps\n  - Bodyweight Thrusters: 2 sets of 8-10 reps\n\n- Day 2 (Back/Bench): \n  - Barbell Deadlifts: 3 sets of 8-10 reps\n  - Push-Ups: 3 sets of 8-10 reps\n  \n- Day 3: Rest or light cardio/stretching\n\n**Weeks 3 & 4:**\n\n- Day 1 (Legs/Thrusters): \n  - Squat: 4 sets of 8-10 reps\n  - Dumbbell Thrusters: 2 sets of 8-10 reps\n\n- Day 2 (Back/Bench): \n  - Deadlifts: 4 sets of 8-10 reps\n  - Bench Press (if available): 3 sets of 8-10 reps\n\n- Day 3: Rest or light cardio/stretching\n\nEnsure you warm up",
